<h2>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</h2>

<p>Good news! You've been given a CardJoy promo code worth <strong><%= @promo_code.credit_amount %> credit<%= "s" unless @promo_code.credit_amount == 1 %></strong>. 🎉</p>

<p>
  Your code:<br>
  <strong style="font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 1px;"><%= @promo_code.code.upcase %></strong>
</p>

<% if @promo_code.expires_at.present? %>
  <p>Redeem it before <strong><%= @promo_code.expires_at.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></strong>.</p>
<% end %>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @redeem_url %>">Redeem your credits</a>
</p>

<p>Enjoy creating and sending beautiful cards to your loved ones!</p>

<hr>
<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #999;">Team CardJoy</p>
